RNE8\" alt=\"哪些禮物最容易令人誤會？（01製圖/Photo by Jackie Tsang on Unsplash)\"><figcaption>哪些禮物最容易令人誤會？（01製圖/Photo by Jackie Tsang on Unsplash)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210217/438779252843220992348076.jpeg/hNcQ545GW-tyO0eqjDhnh7w19WROkB1XO5X3yDuV98g\" alt=\"哪些禮物最容易令人誤會？（01製圖/Photo by Jackie Tsang on Unsplash)\"><figcaption>哪些禮物最容易令人誤會？（01製圖/Photo by Jackie Tsang on Unsplash)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210217/438779255875833856012854.jpeg/NU1_7mKob740_xZOrRp-w7eO_NmmMISGghmplYIZqZU\" alt=\"哪些禮物最容易令人誤會？（01製圖/Photo by Jackie Tsang on Unsplash)\"><figcaption>哪些禮物最容易令人誤會？（01製圖/Photo by Jackie Tsang on Unsplash)</figcaption></figure><p>延伸閱讀：</p><p>剛退伍贊助女友母女日本行1萬5 24歲男被一句話刺傷：太少嗎？</p><p>告白神器變時代眼淚？他被甩「吃完整盒」 網笑：現在用這個9成失敗</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-14T12:36:35.990623+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2205,"images":27,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}